<title>SOUTH AFRICA: Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</title>
<headline>Foreigners net buyers of S.Africa bonds last week.</headline>
<dateline>JOHANNESBURG 1996-11-25</dateline>
<text>
<p>Foreigners were net buyers of 485.24 million rand worth of South African bonds last week, latest Bond Exchange of South Africa figures show.</p>
<p>Non-resident transactions (million rand):</p>
<p>				   Week to Nov 22   Year to date</p>
<p>    - purchases		     4,924.22     159,588.07</p>
<p>    - sales			   4,438.98     157,003.92</p>
<p>    - net purchases (sales)	 485.24	 2,584.15</p>
<p>-- Johannesburg newsroom +27 11 482 1003</p>
</text>
